  "body": "Previously it was at:\r\n- https://www.fedramp.gov/rev5/fips/ \r\n\r\nBut that now redirects to:\r\n- https://www.fedramp.gov/rev5/documents-templates\r\n\r\nAnd that used to have a tile for it which would link to:\r\n- https://www.fedramp.gov/resources/documents/FedRAMP_Policy_for_Cryptographic_Module_Selection_v1.1.0.pdf\r\n\r\nWhich still is published, but I don't know if it is a latest version or not.\r\n\r\nShould https://www.fedramp.gov/rev5/documents-templates have a tile / link to \"FedRAMP Policy for Cryptographic Module Selection and Use\" ?",
